OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder in Sean Small
OL,4,Acase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 42-year-old man has denied a charge
OL,7,Fof murdering his elderly neighbour.
OL,9,FSean Small's body was discovered
OL,10,Foutside his Slievenabrock Avenue home
OL,11,Fin Newcastle, County Down, on 24 August
OL,12,F2025.
OL,14,FThe 84-year old convicted sex offender
OL,15,Fdied following what the PSNI described
OL,16,Fas a "brutal and sustained attack".
OL,18,FMark William Bready, also from
OL,19,FSlievenabrock Avenue, appeared in the
OL,20,Fdock of Belfast Crown Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
